<p>HTML: a <code>&lt;div class="card"&gt;Deck&lt;/div&gt;</code> inside <code>&lt;main&gt;</code>. CSS: give <code>.card</code> background <code>#1e293b</code>, text color white, padding <code>12px</code>, border-radius <code>12px</code>, and a visible border (any color).</p>
