<p>Finally, the model can incorporate adaptive techniques that use feedback loops from the developer or trusted sources. There are two morals of this story. The first is that while there have been tremendous advancements in AI, it&#39;s not perfect. The second is simple— don&#39;t always blindly trustAI- generated results to be 10 0 percent correct.</p>
