<h3>Unit map</h3>
<p><strong>Cloud &amp; DevOps</strong> — use the sidebar order as your syllabus; do not skip <em>practice</em> and <em>challenge</em> steps.</p>
<h3>Deeper checklist</h3>
<ul>
