<tr>
<td><strong>Corrective</strong></td>
<td>Fixes after detection—quarantine, reimage, rollback.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Deterrent</strong></td>
<td>Raises attacker cost—monitoring banners, legal warnings (not magic alone).</td>
