<p><strong>Depth 5 — lens on <em>L3-03: Secure baselines and CIS benchmarks</em>:</strong> Engineers often optimize for speed; attackers optimize for <strong>cheap reuse</strong> of stolen creds and known exploits. The winning answer bridges both: ship fast with guardrails—feature flags, staged rollouts, and automated security checks in CI.</p>
