<p><strong>Depth 7 — lens on <em>L3-07: Syslog/journald and remote log shipping idea</em>:</strong> Auditors care about <strong>traceability</strong>: who approved an exception, when it expires, and what compensating control exists. When you answer exam questions about policy, pick the option that leaves an evidence trail, not the one that relies on informal verbal OKs.</p>
