<p><strong>Depth 5 — lens on <em>L5-01: Zero Trust Architecture (NIST SP 800-207 themes)</em>:</strong> Patching and change management appear as <strong>risk tradeoffs</strong>: emergency patches vs testing rings; compensating monitoring when patching lags; and documenting exceptions for auditors.</p>
