<p><strong>Depth 5 — lens on <em>L5-09: Confidential computing (TEEs, attestation)</em>:</strong> Risk decisions are economic: organizations <strong>accept</strong>, <strong>mitigate</strong>, <strong>transfer</strong> (insurance, outsourcing with contracts), or <strong>avoid</strong> (stop the activity). Controls change likelihood or impact; residual risk should be explicit, not invisible.</p>
