<p><strong>Depth 1 — lens on <em>L4-20: M&amp;A technical due diligence security checklist</em>:</strong> Wireless assessments should mention <strong>rogue AP</strong> discovery, client isolation, and guest segmentation—not just “use WPA2” as a slogan. Exam writers like the distinction between personal and enterprise authentication modes at a conceptual level.</p>
