<p><strong>Depth 1 — lens on <em>L5-17: BGP hijacking and RPKI (operator-level awareness)</em>:</strong> Access control stems frequently mix <strong>role</strong> vs <strong>attribute</strong> vs <strong>rule</strong> models; pick the answer that matches the scenario’s constraints (temporary contractor, cross-department data, dynamic tags on resources).</p>
