<p>Security+ rewards <strong>vocabulary precision</strong> and <strong>scenario judgment</strong>. For Level 1 topics, expect paired questions that test whether you know the <em>definition</em>, the <em>correct control family</em>, and the <em>failure mode</em> when misapplied. Use the key terms below as a checklist: if you cannot explain a term in under 20 seconds, revisit the concept.</p>
